 "context": "<div data-type=\"note\" data-has-label=\"true\" id=\"fs-id2115575\" class=\"interactive-embedded-homework\" data-label=\"\">\n<div data-type=\"title\">Link to Learning</div>\n<span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-id2051508\" data-alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\">\n<img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20240910.161227/resources/f323c87a626b970c4a47d14425498182ba9893b7\" data-media-type=\"image/png\" alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\">\n</span>\n<p id=\"fs-id1430986\">Watch an animation of how cancer results from errors in the cell cycle.\n\n</p>\n<div data-type=\"media\" id=\"eip-id1169995709332\" data-alt=\"cancer\">\n<div class=\"os-has-iframe os-has-link\" data-type=\"switch\">\n<a class=\"os-is-link\" href=\"https://openstax.org/books/biology/pages/10-4-cancer-and-the-cell-cycle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" data-media=\"print\">Access multimedia content</a>\n<iframe width=\"660\" height=\"371.4\" src=\"https://www.openstaxcollege.org/l/cancer\" class=\"os-is-iframe\" data-media=\"screen\"><!-- no-selfclose --></iframe>\n</div>\n                 </div>\n</div>",
